{"id":72780,"date":"2026-11-04T08:33:11","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:33:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72780"},"modified":"2026-11-04T09:37:56","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:37:56","slug":"hybrid-day-aveiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hybrid-day-aveiro\/","title":{"rendered":"Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>23 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, nos pavilh\u00f5es do <strong>Parque de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es de Aveiro (Aveiro Parquexpo)<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da cidade e distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Esta competi\u00e7\u00e3o constitui a segunda etapa oficial da \u00e9poca 2026\/2027 da <strong>Hybrid Day Iberian League<\/strong> (logo ap\u00f3s a abertura em Vigo), trazendo a Portugal um dia inteiro de corrida combinada com esta\u00e7\u00f5es de fitness funcional para atletas de todos os n\u00edveis.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Segundo o Anexo I do Regulamento Oficial, o formato segue uma estrutura padronizada que alterna <strong>8 corridas de 1.000 m<\/strong> (perfazendo <strong>8 km<\/strong> de corrida) com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de workout funcional<\/strong>: <strong>1.000 m SkiErg<\/strong>, <strong>50 m Sled Push<\/strong>, <strong>50 m Sled Pull<\/strong>, <strong>80 m Burpee Broad Jump<\/strong>, <strong>1.000 m RowErg<\/strong>, <strong>200 m Farmer's Carry<\/strong>, <strong>100 m Walking Lunge com Sandbag<\/strong> e <strong>100 Wallballs<\/strong> antes de cruzar o p\u00f3rtico de meta junto aos canais da Ria de Aveiro.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Exclama\u00e7\u00e3o Radical, Lda. (HYBRID DAY\u00ae)<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de tr\u00eas formatos competitivos reservados a maiores de 18 anos: <strong>Singles<\/strong> (Men, Women, Men Pro e Women Pro), <strong>Doubles<\/strong> em regime <em>You Go, I Go<\/em> (Men, Women, Mixed, Men Pro e Women Pro) e <strong>Relay<\/strong> (estafetas de 4 atletas masculinas, femininas ou mistas 2+2), pontuando para o ranking ib\u00e9rico de apuramento para o <em>Champions Day<\/em>. Descobre tamb\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/o-que-e-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">o que \u00e9 o HYROX<\/a> e consulta o calend\u00e1rio completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Provas HYROX<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es de Aveiro (Aveiro Parquexpo), Aveiro<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 x 1.000 m Run + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Funcionais (Singles, Doubles e Relay)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Exclama\u00e7\u00e3o Radical, Lda. \/ HYBRID DAY\u00ae<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tipo de Piso<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Indoor \/ Pista de Corrida e Zona Funcional (Roxzone)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Perfil & Relevo<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Plano (Pavilh\u00e3o Indoor)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/league.hybrid-day.com\/docs\/regulamentos\/2026-2027\/Regulamento_HybridDay_PT.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Singles \u2013 Individual (Men \/ Women \/ Pro)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 Jan<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Doubles \u2013 Duplas (Men \/ Women \/ Mixed \/ Pro)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 Jan<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Relay \u2013 Estafetas de 4 Atletas (Men \/ Women \/ Mixed)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 Jan<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 23 de janeiro de 2027, no Parque de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es de Aveiro (Aveiro Parquexpo), sendo a segunda prova oficial da temporada 2026\/2027 da Hybrid Day Iberian League.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a estrutura oficial de corrida e das 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es do Hybrid Day?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Cada esta\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 precedida por 1.000 m de corrida (total de 8 km): 1) 1.000 m Run + 1.000 m Ski; 2) 1.000 m Run + 50 m Sled Push; 3) 1.000 m Run + 50 m Sled Pull; 4) 1.000 m Run + 80 m Burpee Broad Jump; 5) 1.000 m Run + 1.000 m Row; 6) 1.000 m Run + 200 m Farmer's Carry; 7) 1.000 m Run + 100 m Walking Lunge (Sandbag); 8) 1.000 m Run + 100 Wallballs.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as categorias e escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Age Groups) dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 aberta a maiores de 18 anos e divide-se em Singles (Men, Women, Men Pro e Women Pro), Doubles (Men, Women, Mixed, Men Pro e Women Pro, onde os dois atletas correm juntos e partilham as esta\u00e7\u00f5es em formato YGIG) e Relay (equipas de 4 atletas Men, Women ou Mixed 2+2, em que cada elemento realiza 2 corridas de 1 km e 2 esta\u00e7\u00f5es). Os Age Groups em Singles e Doubles s\u00e3o: 18\u201329, 30\u201334, 35\u201339, 40\u201344, 45\u201349, 50\u201354 e 55+.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando s\u00e3o divulgados os hor\u00e1rios de partida (Heats) e o Race Map?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os Heats (hor\u00e1rios individuais de partida de cada atleta ou equipa) s\u00e3o anunciados cerca de duas semanas antes da prova, seguindo habitualmente a ordem Singles, Doubles e Relay. O Race Map oficial \u00e9 publicado at\u00e9 3 dias antes do evento.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 poss\u00edvel alterar a categoria ou o titular do bilhete ap\u00f3s a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com o regulamento oficial, eventuais altera\u00e7\u00f5es de categoria ou de titularidade est\u00e3o sujeitas a aprova\u00e7\u00e3o da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 3 dias antes da publica\u00e7\u00e3o dos Heats (atrav\u00e9s de support@hybrid-day.com), mediante taxa administrativa entre 10 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac proporcional \u00e0 proximidade do evento. Ap\u00f3s a sa\u00edda dos Heats n\u00e3o s\u00e3o permitidas trocas de categoria.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-23\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es de Aveiro (Aveiro Parquexpo)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027 realiza-se a 23 de janeiro no Aveiro Parquexpo. 8 km de corrida e 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es em Singles, Doubles e Relay. Garante j\u00e1 o teu lugar!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-hybrid-day-aveiro.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/hybrid-day.com\/aveiro-2027\/\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Exclama\u00e7\u00e3o Radical, Lda. \/ HYBRID DAY\u00ae\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Hybrid Day Aveiro 2027 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 23 de janeiro de 2027, no Parque de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es de Aveiro (Aveiro Parquexpo), sendo a segunda prova oficial da temporada 2026\/2027 da Hybrid Day Iberian League.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a estrutura oficial de corrida e das 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es do Hybrid Day?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cada esta\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 precedida por 1.000 m de corrida (total de 8 km): 1) 1.000 m Run + 1.000 m Ski; 2) 1.000 m Run + 50 m Sled Push; 3) 1.000 m Run + 50 m Sled Pull; 4) 1.000 m Run + 80 m Burpee Broad Jump; 5) 1.000 m Run + 1.000 m Row; 6) 1.000 m Run + 200 m Farmer's Carry; 7) 1.000 m Run + 100 m Walking Lunge (Sandbag); 8) 1.000 m Run + 100 Wallballs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as categorias e escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Age Groups) dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 aberta a maiores de 18 anos e divide-se em Singles (Men, Women, Men Pro e Women Pro), Doubles (Men, Women, Mixed, Men Pro e Women Pro, onde os dois atletas correm juntos e partilham as esta\u00e7\u00f5es em formato YGIG) e Relay (equipas de 4 atletas Men, Women ou Mixed 2+2, em que cada elemento realiza 2 corridas de 1 km e 2 esta\u00e7\u00f5es). Os Age Groups em Singles e Doubles s\u00e3o: 18\u201329, 30\u201334, 35\u201339, 40\u201344, 45\u201349, 50\u201354 e 55+.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando s\u00e3o divulgados os hor\u00e1rios de partida (Heats) e o Race Map?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os Heats (hor\u00e1rios individuais de partida de cada atleta ou equipa) s\u00e3o anunciados cerca de duas semanas antes da prova, seguindo habitualmente a ordem Singles, Doubles e Relay. O Race Map oficial \u00e9 publicado at\u00e9 3 dias antes do evento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 poss\u00edvel alterar a categoria ou o titular do bilhete ap\u00f3s a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De acordo com o regulamento oficial, eventuais altera\u00e7\u00f5es de categoria ou de titularidade est\u00e3o sujeitas a aprova\u00e7\u00e3o da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 3 dias antes da publica\u00e7\u00e3o dos Heats (atrav\u00e9s de support@hybrid-day.com), mediante taxa administrativa entre 10 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac proporcional \u00e0 proximidade do evento. Ap\u00f3s a sa\u00edda dos Heats n\u00e3o s\u00e3o permitidas trocas de categoria.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72781,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[1455],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-72780","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-aveiro","event_type-hyrox","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-hybrid-day-aveiro.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72780","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=72780"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72780\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":72783,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72780\/revision